A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the team action battle game known as '''FestiBattle''' (フェスティバトル, ''Fesutibatoru'', '''Festive Battle''') was held from September 30th, 2024 to October 14th, 2024.<br>
The game is published by COLOPL, inc.

