==Event==
Characters from [[The Battle Cats]] are available to be unlocked in the FestiBattle app.
*[[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]: Could be obtained by competing in battles to level up the collaboration event pass.
*Mohawk Cat (Skin for Cat): Could be unlocked via the collaboration exclusive gacha.
*[[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]] (Skin for Cat): Could be obtained by completing the collaboration event pass.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: Could be obtained via the collaboration exclusive gacha by obtaining the character itself or by obtaining accessories related to the character.
*[[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]: Could be obtained via the collaboration exclusive gacha by obtaining the character itself or by obtaining accessories related to the character.
*[[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Boogie Cat]]: Could be unlocked via the collaboration exclusive gacha by obtaining the character itself or by obtaining accessories related to the character.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Could be unlocked via the collaboration exclusive gacha by obtaining the character itself or by obtaining accessories related to the character.

